<title>UK: Britain may review TI /Forsheda buy.</title>
<headline>Britain may review TI /Forsheda buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading said on Tuesday it was contemplating a competition review of engineering firm TI Group Plc's plan to buy Sweden's Forsheda AB and was inviting comment from interested parties.</p>
<p>In a statement, the OFT said that such representations should be made to it by December 17.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
